  <text xml:lang="la">
    <front>
      <div xml:id="starts-on">
        <pb ed="#P" n="1240C"/>
      </div>
    </front>
    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is4">
        <head xml:id="gom-is4-Hd1e98">Caput 4</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is4-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is4-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is4-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is4-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is4_1@1-3">Et apprehendent septem.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is4-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-is4-Nd1e110" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is4-Qd1e113"><seg type="qs">Cum Nabuchodonosor Sedeciam regem</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">hoc loco plures possumus intelligere.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is4-d1e121">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is4-Qd1e123" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is4_1@3-4">Septem mulieres.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is4-Rd1e126"><name xml:id="gom-is4-Nd1e127" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is4-Qd1e130">Septem dona Spiritus sancti: <quote xml:id="gom-is4-Qd1e132" source="http://scta.info/resource/is11_2@7-18">Spiritus sapientiae et intellectus, spiritus consilii et fortitudinis, spiritus scientiae et pietatis, et replebit eum Spiritus timoris Domini.</quote> Quae mulieres dicuntur, quia nemo generatur Deo, nisi per Spiritum: et pluraliter, quia plura sunt dona, cum Spiritus unus.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is4-d1e137">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1240D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is4-Qd1e141" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is4_1@11-12">Panem nostrum.</quote>
            Panis noster Christus est, virga de radice Jesse, et flos; mulierum panis Pater est, sicut et Christi, qui ait: <quote xml:id="gom-is4-Qd1e144" source="http://scta.info/resource/io4_34@4-13">Meus cibus est, ut faciam voluntatem Patris mei</quote>.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is4-d1e148">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is4-Qd1e150" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is4_1@11-13">Panem nostrum comedemus,</quote>
            corpus Christi.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is4-d1e155">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is4-Qd1e157" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is4_1@15-17">Vestimentis nostris operiemur.</quote>
            Ornamentis virtutum.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is4-d1e161">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is4-Qd1e163" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is4_1@19-21">Invocetur nomen tuum.</quote>
            A Christo dicamur Christiani.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is4-d1e167">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is4-Qd1e169" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is4_1@24-25">Aufer opprobrium.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is4-Qd1e172"><seg type="qs">Quod patimur a Judaeis tanquam sine Deo</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">saepe cogamur mutare hospitium.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is4-d1e180">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is4-Qd1e182" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is4_1@24-24">Aufer.</quote>
            Quia consurgent contra sapientiam falsae doctrinae, et contra caeteras mulieres, id est, virtutes: unicuique suum insurgit contrarium, cum nomen earum falsae virtutes subripiunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is4-Dd1e187">
          <head xml:id="gom-is4-Hd1e189">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is4-d1e191">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1241A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is4-Qd1e195" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is4_5@13-13">Nubem,</quote>
            id est, obumbrationem Spiritus, in prosperis ne eleventur, sicut filiis Israel nubes in die erat, ignis in nocte.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is4-d1e199">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is4-Qd1e201" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is4_5@16-17">Et fumum,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-is4-Rd1e204"><name xml:id="gom-is4-Nd1e205" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is4-Qd1e208">Unde: <quote xml:id="gom-is4-Qd1e210" source="http://scta.info/resource/ex13_5@4-8">Domus impleta est fumo</quote>; et alibi: <quote xml:id="gom-is4-Qd1e213" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps103_32@9-13">Qui tangit montes, et fumigant</quote>.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is4-d1e218">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is4-Qd1e220" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is4_5@24-26">Super omnem enim.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is4-Qd1e223"><seg type="qs">Plurimi Judaeorum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">nos autem ad primum Christi adventum.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
